WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.340
Greetings, hot Satan lovers, and welcome to
episode 4 of "American Horror Story: Apocalypse",

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:10.540
where we take a deep dive into the episode and
explore some of the mysteries and theories within.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.820
So fold your towels and clean your
crock pots, ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.620
we're in for one hell of a ride.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:20.740
The episode begins with Tatan - that's Satan +
Tate - recounting his childhood with robot mom.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.640
But in all actuality, this is his real
mother who Mead is based off.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:29.760
They say a prayer to the Dark Lord before
starting their meal and end it by saying NEMA,

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.220
which is Amen spelled backwards.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:36.080
Notice Langdon's hair here looks
awfully like Tate's from season 1,

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:40.280
also hinting that his real mother is
somehow connected with Jessica Lange.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:44.480
She explains that she killed her first
three husbands for the insurance policies.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:49.900
And it's just great to see a beautiful mother-son
bonding moment over prayers to the Dark Lord

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.080
and talk of murder.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.780
Behind her is a picture of Baphomet -
I'm probably butchering that name -,

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:59.340
a symbol supposedly worshipped by
the Knights Templar in the late 1300s,

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:02.200
which was later adopted by the Satanist Movement.

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:08.000
In the 1800's occultist Aleister Crowley
referred to Baphomet as the Divine Androgyne,

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.680
an androgynous being
composed of both male and female parts.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:16.980
Which hints at Michael Langdon who, if you remember when he's questioned by Venable in episode 2,

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:19.740
hints that he might not actually be a man.

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:21.360
We'll come back to this point in a bit.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:25.940
Back in real time, Langdon tells Mead that
he needs someone to help rebuild this world

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:29.560
and Mead, for the first time,
feels like she's found her place.

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:34.340
She's come a long way in just a few minutes, 
but that's when Langdon senses the witches.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:38.800
We're back where we left off with Cordelia
having risen Mallory, Dinah and Coco.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:43.200
They were under an identity spell, which
Cordelia put on them for their own protection.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.460
Because they're special and she
needs them for the upcoming war.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:52.400
Dinah isn't having it and Madison tells her, "As if you
could defeat anyone with that backwards voodoo shit",

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:57.080
hinting that she is somehow related to
Marie Laveau's voodoo witchcraft from season 3.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:59.560
Langdon confronts them and tells them they can't win,

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:01.860
before Myrtle reveals that he is a warlock.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.040
But is he?

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:04.700
We'll get into that in a bit.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.700
We then flash back three years to Warlock Hogwarts.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:12.600
Kids chant, "Igneme accende",
Latin meaning "to burn or ignite".

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:18.780
A level 1 student arrives late and is chastised by
Behold Chablis, one of the teachers at the school.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:22.720
We'll learn that there are four levels
of warlock, level 1 being the weakest.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:28.600
Chablis tells the student if he's late he'll wind up at the Magic Castle doing card tricks like Neil Patrick Harris,

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:32.960
a nod to Neil's character in season 4
 "Freak Show", where he plays a magician.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:37.480
They also chant "ex forma 
mutate, facti sunt figura nova",

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:40.840
which is Latin for "Change form, become a new shape".

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.080
Chablis tells them their power's woven into their DNA.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:48.300
Does that mean Timmy and Emily, who
were told they have special DNA in episode 1,

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.120
are also witch and warlock?

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:53.440
They turn a bunch of perfectly
good gems into an aluminum ball,

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.120
making it the easiest aluminum ball challenge.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.560
"Look how big this thing is right now!"

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:03.000
The scientist from Jurassic Park comes in 
and tells Chablis they've been summoned.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:07.660
Here, we meet the two other teachers,
John Henry Moore and the Grand Chancellor Ariel,

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:10.380
who is, coincidentally, named after an archangel.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:14.020
The teachers watch a video of Langdon
training the world's greatest contortionist

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.540
while discussing his powers.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:19.960
Are his powers his own or are they
more demonic, as John Henry suggests.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:24.660
The warlocks, we learn, are not evil. In fact,
they don't even want dark energy around them.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:29.920
Ariel suggests this boy could be the one the
prophecy suggested, the one they've been looking for.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.460
The Alpha, the warlocks' version of a Supreme.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:36.700
A being so powerful, he'd be able to
pass the test of the Seven Wonders,

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:41.720
the same test Zoe, Madison, Misty and
Queenie undergo in the finale of season 3.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.840
If his powers are real, he could supplant the Supreme.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.820
Ariel springs Langdon from
jail and tells him he's a warlock.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:52.520
Langdon tells him he got in jail for defending
his mother when we get this lovely flashback:

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.240
Mrs. Satan wants a goat's head for incantations

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:58.560
and accuses the butcher of
discrimination for her religious beliefs.

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:01.520
This also happened in real
life when a group of Satanists

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:04.940
attempted to put a statue of
Baphomet next to the Ten Commandments,

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.740
and when they were told to take it down,
said it was religious discrimination.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:14.100
Langdon does his best Arthur meme and uses his telekinetic power to stab the guy with butcher knives.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.400
The irony of a butcher being butchered.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:21.660
Ariel tells Michael his life's about to begin and
uses his warlock power to open the cell door.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.340
They're stopped by an officer, but
Ariel uses his powers once again.

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:28.280
He's innocent of all charges. I'm taking him with me.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.720
They escape, but Langdon kills the
officer, hinting the malevolence within him.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:36.360
Mead is there somehow, knowing
her boy will make her proud someday.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:41.040
Ariel explains that in 2014, Cordelia
outed the magic users to the world.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.700
They became discriminated
and had to move underground,

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.600
because locals threw
Molotov cocktails into their school.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:50.220
Michael's welcome, but it looks
like John Henry still has his doubts.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.340
One month in, Langdon is evaluated by the warlocks.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:57.200
He is to be assigned his level, and
we learn the teachers are all level 3.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:00.520
A level 4 would make them
as powerful as the female Supreme,

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.060
and there's never been a level 4 warlock.

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:08.080
The level 1 test involves scrying, the
ability to see things on a reflective surface.

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:12.020
He must find a book, "The New Adam
and Eve" by Nathaniel Hawthorne,

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:17.560
a story about how after the destruction of Earth,
God created a new Adam and Eve to start over.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.020
He's tasked to find out where the book was hidden,

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:23.420
but goes one step further and
actually retrieves it from the mirror.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:28.060
The next task involves "salire per
spatium", Latin for "jump through space".

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:31.520
He is easily able to dodge the brick
and knife and is found on the ceiling,

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.840
just like the rubber man in episode 2.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.020
Finally, "stiricidium", or "snowfall".

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:40.660
Not only is he able to conjure
snow, but something takes over him.

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.760
The wind and cold becomes too
unbearable for Baldwin, who can't breathe.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:46.560
Ariel stops him and is pleased.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:50.760
If he can learn to control these powers,
there's no limit to how high he can soar.

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:55.420
At dinner, the teachers talk about Langdon
being the most powerful warlock they've ever seen.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.760
They're grooming him to take on the witches.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:00.040
Only John Henry is the one who has doubts.

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:05.600
There's malevolence to his magic, leading
me to believe he is not the Alpha nor a warlock.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:09.580
His powers stem from Satan
himself. He's a false prophet.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:12.780
Also, if you can do this, sign me up for warlock school.

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:15.620
They then toast to the moment everything changes.

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:18.620
We're back in the coven,
bitches, and Zoe is now a teacher.

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:22.480
Mallory is one of the students and
turns the rose into blue butterflies.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.540
Zoe even says her bloodline
goes all the way back to Salem,

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:29.700
Salem being the location of the
infamous witch trials of the late 1600s,

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:35.820
in which over 600 young women were accused of
being witches, 19 of them executed by hanging.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:40.480
Myrtle informs Cordelia and Zoe that the
warlocks have called an emergency council meeting

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.180
at the Hawthorne School for Exceptional Young Men.

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:47.780
The same last name of the author of the book
Langdon was tasked to retrieve in the scrying test.

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:51.980
At the council meeting, Ariel explains
that the boy's powers are so impressive,

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:53.680
they matched those of the Supreme.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:57.080
The witches scoff and Cordelia
reminds him that in all of history,

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.980
no man has ever approached the level of Supreme.

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:03.260
Men aren't equal to women
when it comes to magical ability.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:06.980
Testosterone is a known inhibitor
impeding access to the ethereal realm.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:11.160
Once again hinting that Langdon
is not male, or at least not fully.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:14.540
Ariel wants the witches to
administer the test of the seven wonders,

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:18.460
but Cordelia won't do it because
she'd be condemning this boy to his death.

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:21.980
After all, she lost Misty by
administering the test too early.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:27.600
And let's all say a big hello to Queenie, who's been trapped in the hotel Cortez, the setting for season 5.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:32.720
She's been in a never-ending card game with
March, a serial killer and builder of the Cortez.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:38.640
Cordelia explains that the hotel wasn't haunted,
rather it was a doorway to Hell where the devil reigns.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:43.600
Her spells were useless in that hotel, hinting
that when the witches fight the demonic forces,

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:46.600
their spells won't work or will be severely weakened.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:52.360
Cordelia's efforts to save Queenie end in failure,
and she considers it her worst failure as Supreme.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:57.120
As the supreme in charge of caring for all
people, meaning both the witches and warlocks,

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.260
she denies giving the test to
Langdon, fearing his safety.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:05.120
Ariel says she's just scared of the Alpha,
the one to bring the end of female domination.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:10.660
A role reversal what's going on in society today:
the push for equality, the MeToo movement,

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.460
and even Cordelia using the phrase "Time is up".

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:17.980
But in this world, the females are dominant
and the men are the ones striving for equality.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.660
Langdon is possessed and draws the hotel Cortez.

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:23.420
Something is taking control
of him, beckoning him there.

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:27.920
And soon we see him come to the rescue of
Queenie, to do what her Supreme couldn't.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.990
March seems to sense his power, probably
because he knows what's controlling Michael.

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:35.960
He immediately knows she won't
be back, saying, "Solitaire it is".

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:39.700
Able to get her out, Langdon
says there's one person left to get.

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:43.200
Madison works customer
returns in her own eternal Hell.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:47.320
She's undervalued, overworked
and, worst of all, unrecognized.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.020
She's even cattle prodded by her boss Randall.

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:52.500
I even loved the neverending line of her turns.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.720
Langdon comes to claim her
soul and save her from this Hell.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.100
Madison hoes it up, telling him he's a snack

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:01.740
and how terrible that they're always
out of stock of personal massagers

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.460
before Queenie arrives to convince Madison to come.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.960
There's work to do and he needs both of them.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:11.540
But what he really needs is to prove a point:
that his abilities are extremely powerful.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.720
Langdon arrives with Madison
and Queenie and let me just say,

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:18.180
for people who have just returned from
the netherworld, they look fine as hell.

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.540
Cordelia faints as the witches reunite,

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.540
Langdon basking in the knowledge he
was able to do what the others could not.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.120
So what can we expect from the next few episodes?

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.480
We'll likely see two separate timelines:

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:35.040
One, the past, learning how Langdon took over as
Alpha and witnessing the birth of the Cooperative.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:39.180
And two, the current timeline, the
battle between the witches and Satan.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:43.440
Will Michael bring back Misty and will
John Henry Moore defect to the witches?

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.640
We'll have to stay tuned for next episode.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.400
Hey everyone, I hope you liked this video.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.920
If you enjoyed it, please give it a like and subscribe.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:53.100
I'm planning on doing the whole
season, so I hope you'll stick with me.

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:57.620
I also have a new Twitter, where you can find
my video release schedule or just ask me questions.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.420
So give me a follow @ThinkStoryYT.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.060
And last but not least:

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.600
Daddy loves you very much.

